<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 155-6 AT TEA V ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 155-6 AT TEA V ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were 155 for six in reply to England's first innings 156 at tea on the third day of the second cricket test on Saturday.</p>
</text>
